%% title: What is inside an academic year
%% desc: A school has several academic years, and one of them is current. Inside each year are terms, classes and fee structures. Inside a class are sections.
flowchart LR
  S["School"]:::note --> Y1["Academic year<br/>current"]:::admin
  S --> Y2["Other academic year"]:::note
  Y1 --> T["Terms"]
  Y1 --> K["Classes"]:::teacher
  Y1 --> F["Fee structures"]
  K --> SE["Sections"]:::guardian
  classDef teacher fill:#e7f5ff,stroke:#1c7ed6,color:#0b3d66
  classDef admin fill:#fff4e6,stroke:#e8590c,color:#7a2e05
  classDef guardian fill:#ebfbee,stroke:#2b8a3e,color:#14411d
  classDef note fill:#f1f3f5,stroke:#868e96,color:#343a40
